/10 \u2013 WellPlayed<br><br>\u201cAn awesome game and one that I can see myself chilling out and getting lost in a captivating story with a mesmerizing soundtrack.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 SteamDeckHQ<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_9f2e4c1f84af0c2cbe439a5733e0377654170bc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774529050","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_9f2e4c1f84af0c2cbe439a5733e0377654170bc0.600x338.jpg?t=1774529050"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_7126d2fa9f4326b0ceb6717ae4e4ddda61ffe43d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774529050","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_7126d2fa9f4326b0ceb6717ae4e4ddda61ffe43d.600x338.jpg?t=1774529050"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_a6c3312dc96844baa698f68f7afe5de65d7d073a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774529050","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_a6c3312dc96844baa698f68f7afe5de65d7d073a.600x338.jpg?t=1774529050"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_d2775baae7b4412eabf31a5dfa8a5c704b6eca38.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774529050","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_d2775baae7b4412eabf31a5dfa8a5c704b6eca38.600x338.jpg?t=1774529050"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_788bedf1814511d5b418ca348e2ded27b51022b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774529050","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_788bedf1814511d5b418ca348e2ded27b51022b0.600x338.jpg?t=1774529050"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/894620/ss_74b69e072ba5a5668aca50a33a5660c8003